आ-√ पॄ P. -पिपर्ति, -पृणाति, and -पृणति, to fill up, fulfil, fill, RV.; AV.; VS.;
to do any one's desire, satisfy any one's wish, RV. :
Ā. -पृणते, to surfeit one's self, satiate or satisfy one's self, RV. :
Pass. -पूर्यते, to be filled, become full, increase;
to be satiated, satisfied, RV.; ŚBr.; BhP.; MBh.; Kathās. &c.:
Caus. -पूरयति, to fill up, fulfil, fill, ŚBr.; Hariv.; Rājat. &c.;
to fill with noise, MBh.; R.;
to fill with air, to inflate, R.;
to cover;
to load anything with, MBh.; R.; Ṛtus.; Kathās.

आ-√ पृच् P. (Impv. आ॑-पृणक्तु; pf. -पपृचुस्; Inf. -पृ॑चे, RV. v, 50, 2 and -पृ॑चस्, RV. viii, 40, 9)
to fill, pervade;
to satiate, RV. i, 84, 1; TBr.;
to mix with, AitBr. :
Ā. (aor. Pot. आ॑-पृचीमहि) to satiate one's self, RV. i, 129, 7.
